flowchart TD
    A[Verified local branch] --> B[Prepare push]
    B --> C[Review exact Git command]
    C --> D{Approve push?}
    D -- No --> E[Reject operation]
    D -- Yes --> F[Push branch]
    F --> G[Prepare pull request]
    G --> H[Enter base, title and description]
    H --> I[Generate exact gh pr create command]
    I --> J{Approve PR creation?}
    J -- No --> K[Reject proposal]
    J -- Yes --> L[Create pull request]
    L --> M[Load PR detail, diff and checks]
    M --> N{Review outcome}
    N -- Comment --> O[Post conversation comment]
    N -- Changes needed --> P[Request changes]
    N -- Accept --> Q[Approve PR]
    O --> M
    P --> M
